abstract: >-
  Research code for truthful demand reporting in learning-based RAN slicing,
  including PRB allocation, envelope payments, protected priority maps,
  controller training, trace-driven evaluation, recorded result summaries, and
  matched-deadline training, a five-seed original-setting reporting supplement,
  and reproducible statistical analysis.
keywords:
  - RAN slicing
  - mechanism design
  - truthful reporting
  - reinforcement learning
